OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 1 MAR
OL,4,G1800FWords and Music
OL,5,     GFictional robots and poetic
OL,6,     Gautomata alongside music created
OL,7,     Gby and played by machines. With
OL,8,     Greadings from Annette Badland and
OL,9,     GDaniel Millar.
OL,10,G1915FSunday Feature: Bartok and Us
OL,11,     GThe comedian, actor and keen
OL,12,     Gamateur musician Nick Mohammed
OL,13,     Greports on the first British
OL,14,     Gencounters with the music of
OL,15,     GHungarian Bela Bartok and how our
OL,16,     Gattitudes changed over time.
OL,17,G2000FDvorak String Quintet Op.97
OL,18,     GThe Building a Library
OL,19,     Grecommended recording from
OL,20,     Gyesterday's Record Review.
